%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: PavleFullMutantDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Permit. Right. Force of habit.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The gauze finally came off last week. The skin had grown around the edges.
      I didn't have much say in the matter.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The grinding you've been hearing. I used to say it was from the shop.
      It was never from the shop.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: My brother stopped asking questions about a week ago. I think he could
      tell I didn't have good answers anymore.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: The hunger got very specific. Like I told you it would. I just didn't
      know yet what it was hungry for.
    animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Pavle, step back from the window.
      npcResponse: In a moment. I've been looking forward to this for a while.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: What do you want?
      npcResponse: What I've always wanted. Something fresh. I've been very patient.
      animationTrigger: TalkCocky
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I've been coming to this window for a long time. You were always very
      good to me. I want you to know that.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You'd make a very clean cut. I always mean that as a compliment.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
